{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50996","headline":"春日登大悲阁回文（二首） 一 · 钱惟治","name":"春日登大悲阁回文（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主钦崇教，千光显绀容。\n映云窗绮暖，笼月箔花重。\n净刹香风远，危阑碧雾浓。\n胜因良以咏，华国一斯逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱惟治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}